OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, clearing way for $110bn merger
OL,5,Awith Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FParamount Skydance has settled a
OL,8,Flawsuit with a dozen US states, paving
OL,9,Fthe way for its $110bn (#82.8bn) merger
OL,10,Fwith Warner Bros Discovery.
OL,12,FUnder the agreement, Paramount must
OL,13,Fproduce at least 30 films a year and
OL,14,Fensure a certain percentage are
OL,15,Fproduced in the US, or face penalties
OL,16,Fincluding selling off parts of its
OL,17,Fbusiness.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
