OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, clearing way for $110bn merger
OL,5,Awith Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deal clears one of the final
OL,8,Fhurdles for the merger that is set to
OL,9,Freshape Hollywood, combining legacy
OL,10,Fstudios, major streamers, and national
OL,11,Fnetworks under one umbrella.
OL,13,FAnnouncing the settlement, California
OL,14,FAttorney General Rob Bonta said the
OL,15,Fagreement was "not a vote of support
OL,16,Ffor this merger", while Parmount's
OL,17,Fchief executive welcomed the
OL,18,Fresolution.
